ladspa_sdk: LADSPA (Linux Audio Developer's Simple Plugin API) is a standard
ladspa_sdk: that allows software audio processors and effects to be plugged
ladspa_sdk: into a wide range of audio synthesis and recording packages.
ladspa_sdk: For instance, it allows a developer to write a reverb program
ladspa_sdk: and bundle it into a LADSPA "plugin library." Ordinary users can
ladspa_sdk: then use this reverb within any LADSPA-friendly audio application.
ladspa_sdk:
ladspa_sdk: More info: http://www.ladspa.org/
